{"parents": [{"link": "../", "title": "Frequently Asked Questions"}], "prev": {"link": "../socket-send-oserror-timeouterror-connection-lost-reset/", "title": "socket.send(), OSError(), TimeoutError(), Connection lost/reset"}, "next": {"link": "../the-account-has-been-limited-deactivated/", "title": "The account has been limited/deactivated"}, "title": "How to avoid Flood Waits?", "meta": null, "body": "<section id=\"how-to-avoid-flood-waits\">\n<h1>How to avoid Flood Waits?<a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#how-to-avoid-flood-waits\" title=\"Link to this heading\">\u00b6</a></h1>\n<p>Slow things down and make less requests. Moreover, exact limits are unknown and can change anytime based on normal\nusages.</p>\n<p>When a flood wait happens the server will tell you how much time to wait before continuing.\nThe following shows how to catch the exception in your code and wait the required seconds.</p>\n<div class=\"highlight-python notranslate\"><div class=\"highlight\"><pre><span></span><span class=\"kn\">import</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">asyncio</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">pyrogram.errors</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"n\">FloodWait</span>\n\n<span class=\"o\">...</span>\n    <span class=\"k\">try</span><span class=\"p\">:</span>\n        <span class=\"o\">...</span>  <span class=\"c1\"># Your code</span>\n    <span class=\"k\">except</span> <span class=\"n\">FloodWait</span> <span class=\"k\">as</span> <span class=\"n\">e</span><span class=\"p\">:</span>\n        <span class=\"k\">await</span> <span class=\"n\">asyncio</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">sleep</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">e</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">value</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>  <span class=\"c1\"># Wait &quot;value&quot; seconds before continuing</span>\n<span class=\"o\">...</span>\n</pre></div>\n</div>\n<p>More info about error handling can be found <a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"../../start/errors/\"><span class=\"doc\">here</span></a>.</p>\n</section>\n", "metatags": "<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\" />\n", "rellinks": [["genindex", "General Index", "I", "index"], ["py-modindex", "Python Module Index", "", "modules"], ["faq/the-account-has-been-limited-deactivated", "The account has been limited/deactivated", "N", "next"], ["faq/socket-send-oserror-timeouterror-connection-lost-reset", "socket.send(), OSError(), TimeoutError(), Connection lost/reset", "P", "previous"]], "sourcename": "", "toc": "<ul>\n<li><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"#\">How to avoid Flood Waits?</a></li>\n</ul>\n", "display_toc": false, "page_source_suffix": ".rst", "current_page_name": "faq/how-to-avoid-flood-waits", "sidebars": ["sidebar/brand.html", "sidebar/search.html", "sidebar/scroll-start.html", "sidebar/navigation.html", "sidebar/scroll-end.html"], "alabaster_version": "1.0.0", "alabaster_version_info": [1, 0, 0], "furo_version": "2025.12.19", "furo_navigation_tree": "", "furo_hide_toc": true, "furo_pygments": {"light": {"background": "#eeffcc", "foreground": "black"}, "dark": {"background": "#202020", "foreground": "#d0d0d0"}}}